{"id":"n71471-2-4","stage":1,"title":"칠 · 第七","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71471-2-4-1","ko":"내가 이 학교 칠 회 졸업생인데 네가 내 후배라지?","zh":"我是这所学校的七届毕业生，你应该是我的学弟吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"칠","meaning":"第七","explanation":"칠：第七","readings":[{"term":"칠","audio":"/audio/e8eb2f9b25b9fd2fe1b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71471","senseId":"2","lemma":"칠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회","meaning":"届","explanation":"회：届","readings":[{"term":"회","audio":"/audio/0ef6c01e0a84b27b585e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73241","senseId":"2","lemma":"회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"졸업생인데","meaning":"毕业生","explanation":"졸업생：毕业生；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"졸업생","audio":"/audio/3b3c90578e48eccc6d2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91754","senseId":"1","lemma":"졸업생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","sens